BT /F2 13 Tf 72 720 Td (Notes and caveats) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 694 Td (The readers were volunteers recruited through the council's newsletter, so they were) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 679 Td (people who already read council documents and may have been keener than most.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 656 Td (Each reading was timed by the screen software, not by a person with a stopwatch, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 641 Td (the times are exact to the second but include any pause a reader took.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 618 Td (The questions after each document were the same in both readings. A reader who) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 603 Td (remembered a question from the first reading may have looked for its answer in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 588 Td (second, which would favour whichever layout came second.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 565 Td (The twelve documents were chosen to be ordinary rather than difficult. Technical) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 550 Td (manuals and legal texts with dense cross-references were left for a later study.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 527 Td (Three readers did not finish the second reading and were left out entirely, rather) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 512 Td (than counted for the documents they did finish.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 489 Td (The printed copies used for the signed summary were set in the reset layout. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 474 Td (study itself was read entirely on screen.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 451 Td (All the figures in this report are rounded. A change shown as a quarter or a half is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 436 Td (the nearest simple fraction to the measured value.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 413 Td (The reading times in Table 2 are averages over all two hundred readers. The spread) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 398 Td (within each document was about as wide as the spread described on page 2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 375 Td (Satisfaction was asked once per document and reading, not once per page, so it) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 360 Td (cannot be compared with the times per page directly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 337 Td (The study did not track eye movements. Where it says a reader lost their place, it) Tj ET
